+#: Schedule literals that have MOVED. `21:05` was `com.cobalt.replay`'s
+#: `at` until 2026-09-17 R17 put it at 21:10 (`configs/cobalt/jobs.yaml`);
+#: a migration that still names it sends its reader to an occurrence that
